  "notes": [
    "TellorPriceFeed is immutable; the system started reading it when TokenToPriceFeed mapped wALBT to ConvertedPriceFeed 0x7d4c36c7, which wraps it, 14 s after its deployment. Three later wALBT settings kept that feed and changed only MCR and redemption fee, which sized but did not enable the borrow.",
    "Valued at realisation (rule 15): 558,408 BEUR sold for 534,535.91 USDC on Polygon, and 29.8M of the 113.8M wALBT taken from troves sold as ALBT on Ethereum for 756.02 ETH and 20,511.91 USDT. The unsold 84M ALBT and 98M BEUR have no evidenced realisation and add nothing.",
    "TellorFlex worked as designed; the defect is BonqDAO's consumer feed. No other reporter submitted wALBT values before the anchor besides the protocol's two."
